# ============================================================================
# Monorepo Environment Variables Reference
# ============================================================================
# Environment variables are configured in the 'backend' package.
# Please copy backend/.example.env to backend/.env and populate your API credentials:
#
#   cd backend && cp .example.env .env
#
# Required Keys:
# - GOOGLE_API_KEY (Google AI Studio Gemini API)
# - PINECONE_API_KEY & PINECONE_INDEX_NAME (Pinecone Vector DB)
# - SUPABASE_URL & SUPABASE_ANON_KEY (Supabase PostgreSQL)
# ============================================================================
